# Security And No-Claim Proof

App-plan WP13 shares the app/game WP14 no-claim proof:

- Inventory evidence is not app use.
- Running/process evidence is not foreground.
- Foreground evidence is not content knowledge.
- Launcher evidence is not active game/app proof without child evidence.
- AI does not enforce.
- Manual-required actions do not execute adapters.
- Duplicate observations do not double count duration after replay.

Validation:

```text
cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-core app_game_journal_sqlite -- --nocapture
PASS: 3 tests.
```
